{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07367","headline":"奉使新安自桐庐县经严陵钓台宿七里滩下寄使院诸公 · 刘长卿","name":"奉使新安自桐庐县经严陵钓台宿七里滩下寄使院诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠然钓台下，怀古时一望。\n江水自潺湲，行人独惆怅。\n新安从此始，桂檝方荡漾。\n回转百里间，青山千万状。\n连崖去不断，对岭遥相向。\n夹岸黛色愁，沈沈绿波上。\n夕阳留古木，水鸟拂寒浪。\n月下扣舷声，烟中采菱唱。\n犹怜负羁束，未暇依清旷。\n牵役徒自劳，近名非所向。\n何时故山里，却醉松花酿。\n回首唯白云，孤舟复谁访。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}